    "https://careers.maryville.edu/?_ga=2.65064999.867605969.1689610591-885137803.1623179314": {
      "title": "Join Our Team",
      "description": "Employment | Maryville University Skip to main content Search Close Search Menu About Programs Admissions Athletics Student Life Alumni Giving Online Events Search Student Login Join Our Team When you work with Maryville University, you are part of a vibrant community leading a revolution in higher education. With strategic precision and vision, we’re building a university for the future. Faculty & Staff Positions Includes full-time faculty, administrative, and staff positions. View Opportunities Adjunct Positions Explore current part-time positions across all departments. View Opportunities Student Employment Explore current student employment openings across all departments. View Opportunities Our Community and Vision Maryville is a unique community that prepares students for success, personal growth, and meaningful engagement with the world. At Maryville, students, faculty, staff, and alumni come together to create something truly special. Explore our community and our commitment to leading innovation in higher education by expanding access and opportunity for everyone. Benefits at a glance Maryville offers a comprehensive benefits package designed to support your health, growth, and work-life balance. Medical Insurance Comprehensive health coverage starts the month after you’re hired. Choose a QHDHP or PPO—both include virtual visits, 100% covered preventive care in-network, mental health support, and affordable prescriptions. Disability Insurance Enjoy peace of mind with fully covered Long-Term Disability Insurance, provided at no cost to full-time employees. Full-time employees have the option to purchase Short-Term Disability Insurance on a voluntary basis. Life Insurance Protect your loved ones with University-paid Life and AD&D coverage equal to one year’s salary. Full-time employees can also purchase additional coverage for themselves, spouses, and dependents. Retirement Program Plan for your future with our TIAA retirement program. Get a 100% match on contributions from 2%–9%, with full vesting after 3 years. Enjoy access to financial tools, resources, and one-on-one consultations. Tuition Remission Invest in your education and your family’s future! Full undergraduate tuition remission is available for employees, spouses/partners, and dependents after one year. Time Off Take advantage of our generous time off, including holidays, vacation, personal days, and sick leave, to maintain a healthy work-life balance. Employee Assistance Program We provide free access to our Employee Assistance Program (EAP) to help you and your family members find the solutions and resources you need to tackle life’s challenges. Additional Perks Enjoy free parking, access to on-campus fitness centers and nature trails, and discounts at the campus store. Why Join Us? Comprehensive Benefits: Tailored to support your health, financial security, and professional growth. Work-Life Balance: Generous time off and flexible benefits to meet your needs. Career Development: Tuition remission and retirement planning tools to help you grow personally and professionally. X What are you looking for? Schedule A Visit How To Apply Request Information Find My Major Connect Resources People & Places Giving Current Student Login Mpress Blog Facebook Twitter Snapchat Instagram YouTube Maryville Online Blog Academic Calendar Ask Maryville Catalog Calendar of Events Campus Map Course Search Consumer Information Employment ePay Financial Aid Institutional Research Library Policy Library Public Safety Strategic Plan Web Accessibility Adjunct Faculty Faculty/Staff Directory Health & Wellness Human Resources Online Education Office of The President EO and Title IX Resource Center Student Financial Services Student Success Strategic Marketing & Communications The M Store Give Now Ways To Give Giving To Maryville Duchesne Society Scholarship and Naming Opportunities ©2026 Maryville University | Accessibility Statement | Privacy Policy | 1-800-627-9855 Close Menu About Programs Admissions Athletics Student Life Alumni Giving Online Events Search Student Login Trivia Results CLOSE"
    },
